Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:54.08,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}谢尔顿 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁵ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁷{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 阿尔卡拉斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Ben, it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,本 已经很晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll try to make this quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们尽量快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:07.80,EN,,0,0,0,,but I mean the question is just how How
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,但问题就是 怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:08.36,EN,,0,0,0,,did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.42,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you have the energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,你哪来这样的体力？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:10.58,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you have the resolve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,你哪来这样的决心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:14.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to do that in five sets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,撑下这场五盘大战？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:26.44,EN,,0,0,0,,You know for me For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说 对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.56,EN,,0,0,0,,it's always about the people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,始终是因为现场的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:30.18,EN,,0,0,0,,in the crowd whether it's you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,看台上的每个人 无论是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:31.06,EN,,0,0,0,,My coaches and my team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:31.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的教练和团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,over there all my family and friends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,那边 还有我的家人朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:35.38,EN,,0,0,0,,over here Or the city of New York
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,这边 还有纽约这座城
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,that showed up tonight till 3 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚陪我们撑到凌晨三点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:45.00,EN,,0,0,0,,With the USA chants until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,USA的呐喊一直响到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,That's what kept me going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你们让我坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's what got me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,也帮我拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:49.92,EN,,0,0,0,,this win tonight Well you you know you set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚这场胜利 你创下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:50.22,EN,,0,0,0,,a record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,一项纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:51.42,EN,,0,0,0,,It's past 3 a.m..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在已经过了凌晨三点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.48,EN,,0,0,0,,This is way past the longest This has ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这远超以往最晚的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:54.86,EN,,0,0,0,,been so what do you have to say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:54.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想说些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.30,EN,,0,0,0,,to this crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,对这些观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that actually stayed here cheering for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们一直留下来为你加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.14,EN,,0,0,0,,I heard a lot of USA chants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我听到阵阵USA的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.82,EN,,0,0,0,,I heard a lot of 'Go Ben!' Means
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有本 加油的呐喊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:09.99,EN,,0,0,0,,so much to them that you did this Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:09.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,你赢了 意义重大 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:12.59,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's it's it's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的 真的太不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:12.95,EN,,0,0,0,,I always say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,我总说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:14.27,EN,,0,0,0,,that this is the greatest sports city
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:14.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里是最棒的体育之城
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:14.95,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world I say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:14.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,在全世界 我说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:16.03,EN,,0,0,0,,that this is the greatest stadium
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里是最棒的球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.03,0:01:21.23,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world I'm just hoping
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.03,0:01:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,在全世界 我只希望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.69,EN,,0,0,0,,that my my best friend and my sister
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友和我的姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.69,0:01:24.91,EN,,0,0,0,,over there don't have to be at work
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.69,0:01:24.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那边 不用去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:25.97,EN,,0,0,0,,at 6 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:25.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,早上六点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:28.37,EN,,0,0,0,,In three hours It'd be huge
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:28.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,也就是三小时后 那就太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:29.11,EN,,0,0,0,,from their employers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,要是他们的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:30.41,EN,,0,0,0,,to let them have the day off today,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,能让他们今天放一天假
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:34.37,EN,,0,0,0,,but No, I'm just I'm just so grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过 我真的非常感激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:35.97,EN,,0,0,0,,so blessed God's blessed me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:35.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,很有福气 上帝眷顾我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:37.09,EN,,0,0,0,,in so many ways to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:37.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,在很多方面 让我来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:38.53,EN,,0,0,0,,in front of you guys tonight It's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:38.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚 站在你们面前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:40.15,EN,,0,0,0,,an absolute honor sharing the court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:40.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,同场竞技是莫大的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:41.67,EN,,0,0,0,,with Carlos is an absolute honor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,和卡洛斯打球 是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:43.49,EN,,0,0,0,,and I cherish every moment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:43.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,我珍惜每一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:45.11,EN,,0,0,0,,that I have out here Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:45.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这里的每一刻 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.11,0:01:46.27,EN,,0,0,0,,you've got the day off tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.11,0:01:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,你明天可以休息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:48.11,EN,,0,0,0,,and the next day enjoy it get
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:48.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,后天也能休息 好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:49.85,EN,,0,0,0,,to the recovery You ladies
